&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above; computer science, software engineering, networking or other related majors are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 3 years of working experience in IT support, IT engineering or a similar hands-on technical role, with working experience in large IT companies preferred. Operation and maintenance experience across Windows, macOS, WiFi network, VPN network and smart office systems is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUc6dfFyioKLJyxdlHGudKExsjg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic knowledge of server and network administration: Windows Server or Linux, virtualisation, backup and restore, switches, VLANs, WiFi controllers, firewalls and VPN. Certifications such as CCNA, Microsoft or Linux are a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xo0VdixCRoUklCxHTOXu6JBus0b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated software engineering ability: strong Python (or an equivalent language) plus PowerShell or Bash; comfortable with Git and code review; able to build, test, document and maintain internal tools and integrations against REST APIs. Please be ready to share a portfolio, GitHub profile or examples of tools you have built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xo0VdixCRoUklCxHTOXu6JBus0b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on AI practitioner: daily user of AI assistants (e.g. Claude, ChatGPT) with effective prompting skills, plus practical experience building AI agents, AI skills or MCP integrations. Experience deploying AI solutions for non-technical users is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xo0VdixCRoUklCxHTOXu6JBus0b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable working directly with business stakeholders to turn unclear requirements into practical, deliverable solutions, and capable of presenting and providing training to non-technical users. Strong communication, presentation, and facilitation skills, with a proactive approach to problem-solving. Able to work independently and collaboratively, accommodate flexible working hours including evenings &amp;amp; weekends, and travel to regional offices when required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5lMdPzOsooUWxxTU8PuJh7EsLf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent in Malay,English and Mandarin listening and speaking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
