&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EsL0dGaUcoNrbzxIDY5lSWWLgGd&quot;&gt;You will own the full commercial lifecycle for a growing class of listed instruments. You will work across a sophisticated deal pipeline spanning institutional credit products, structured yield instruments, and other on-chain financial assets. The role sits at the intersection of traditional finance expertise and blockchain-native distribution, requiring fluency in both.&lt;/div&gt;
