&lt;p&gt;10+ years of industry experience in a relevant field, or an equivalent combination of advanced degree (PhD/Master&#39;s in Computer Science, AI, Machine Learning, Robotics, or related field) and industry experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJNudcXf2oSMFRxU5dUl5tcxgsf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience building and deploying&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;autonomous AI agents&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in live environments. Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet2&quot;&gt;
